domain RECEIPTS:
  description "Preserve source-owned parameter effects when their net is zero."
evidence FAILURE:
  "Current full V3 battle path rejects receipt owns absent parameter delta b.stamina."
evidence SOURCE:
  "parameterChanges omits zero deltas; buildBattleTurnRecord accumulates nonzero evidence per source but iterates only keys in sparse aggregate diff; schema rejects any owned key absent from aggregate."
premise CONTRACT:
  "Existing source-owned contributions must sum to before-after difference; preserve every attribution and authoritative validator."
premise ALTERNATIVES:
  "Deleting cancelling contributions loses cause ownership. Relaxing schema weakens authoritative contract. Preserve explicit aggregate zero for owned parameters instead."
pending UNKNOWN:
  "The original random action sequence is not captured; deterministic cancelling evidence must reproduce the observed structural condition."
decision REPAIR based_on FAILURE, SOURCE, CONTRACT, ALTERNATIVES:
  "Reproduce opposing contribution zero net, then include every owned parameter in aggregate using real before-after delta and normal remainder reconciliation. Keep schema unchanged."
